! Source for ScheduleTypeLimits (all 4 objects of this class): not in the documents. Kept: prototype values.
! Source for ScheduleTypeLimits "Fraction": not in the xlsx or the PDF. Kept: an EnergyPlus input rule (0 to 1, continuous) that only lets EnergyPlus check the range and the numeric type of the schedule values; it is not a building input and changes no result. For schedules whose values are fractions of a design level (between 0 and 1).
  ScheduleTypeLimits,
    Fraction,                !- Name
    0,                       !- Lower Limit Value
    1,                       !- Upper Limit Value
    Continuous;              !- Numeric Type

! Source for ScheduleTypeLimits "Temperature": not in the xlsx or the PDF. Kept: an EnergyPlus input rule (-100 to 100, continuous) that only lets EnergyPlus check the range and the numeric type of the schedule values; it is not a building input and changes no result. Generic range for temperature schedules (the set points); the EnergyPlus example files use -60 to 200 C; why these numbers is not documented, it is a wide range that no real temperature leaves.
  ScheduleTypeLimits,
    Temperature,             !- Name
    -100,                    !- Lower Limit Value
    100,                     !- Upper Limit Value
    Continuous;              !- Numeric Type

