! Source for Schedule:Compact "INFIL_Door_Opening_SCH": not in the xlsx Schedule Summary. Used only by the entrance door infiltration objects (ZoneInfiltration:DesignFlowRate named ... Door Infiltration); their flow rate is in the xlsx (raw_data column T, Infiltration Through Entrances) but the xlsx gives no schedule for it. The value is the fraction of that flow: 1.0 in the two peak hours (7:00-8:00 and 17:00-18:00), 0.144 in the other hours of use (6:00-22:00), 0 at night; the same every day of the week. The same values 1.0 and 0.144 are used in all the prototypes; why 0.144 (the non-peak flow is 14.4 % of the peak flow) is not documented. Kept: prototype value.
  Schedule:Compact,
    INFIL_Door_Opening_SCH,  !- Name
    fraction,                !- Schedule Type Limits Name
    Through: 12/31,          !- Field 1
    For: AllDays,            !- Field 2
    Until: 06:00,0.0,        !- Field 3
    Until: 07:00,0.144,      !- Field 5
    Until: 08:00,1.0,        !- Field 7
    Until: 17:00,0.144,      !- Field 9
    Until: 18:00,1.0,        !- Field 11
    Until: 22:00,0.144,      !- Field 13
    Until: 24:00,0.0;        !- Field 15

