!  Office_DCV = No

  DesignSpecification:OutdoorAir,
    SZ DSOA Office,          !- Name
    Flow/Area,               !- Outdoor Air Method
    ,                        !- Outdoor Air Flow per Person {m3/s-person}
    0.000508,                !- Outdoor Air Flow per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}  Source: xlsx raw_data!P35 Total OSA Ventilation = 0.0448 m3/s (= this value x zone floor area, x multiplier for repeated floors); the xlsx lists 0 where the outdoor air is set at the air loop. Derivation of the value: xlsx Zone and HVAC System Summary Q466 (62-1999 cfm/person) = 20 cfm/person x 5.000 people per 1000 ft2 (4.75 people in the 949.9 ft2 of the zone) = 0.1 cfm/ft2 x 0.000471947 m3/s per cfm / 0.09290304 m2 per ft2 = 0.000508 m3/s-m2; the xlsx does not list the number of people of the outdoor air calculation separately: the people count here is the number that reproduces this result, and it equals the design occupancy density N466 = 5.000 people per 1000 ft2.
    ,                        !- Outdoor Air Flow per Zone {m3/s}
    ,                        !- Outdoor Air Flow Air Changes per Hour {1/hr}
    ;                        !- Outdoor Air Schedule Name

!    office_mdp = 0.3;

