!-~~~~ ZoneMsc_tmpl: G S2 Apartment ~~~

  Sizing:Zone,
    G S2 Apartment,          !- Zone or ZoneList Name
    SupplyAirTemperature,    !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature Input Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    12.8,                    !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature {C}
    ,                        !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Temperature Difference {deltaC}
    SupplyAirTemperature,    !- Zone Heating Design Supply Air Temperature Input Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    40,                      !- Zone Heating Design Supply Air Temperature {C}
    ,                        !- Zone Heating Design Supply Air Temperature Difference {deltaC}
    0.008,                   !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio {kgWater/kgDryAir}
    0.008,                   !- Zone Heating Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio {kgWater/kgDryAir}
    SZ DSOA G S2 Apartment,  !- Design Specification Outdoor Air Object Name
    ,                        !- Zone Heating Sizing Factor
    ,                        !- Zone Cooling Sizing Factor
    DesignDay,               !- Cooling Design Air Flow Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    0.0,                     !- Cooling Design Air Flow Rate {m3/s}   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    ,                        !- Cooling Minimum Air Flow per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}
    ,                        !- Cooling Minimum Air Flow {m3/s}
    0.0,                     !- Cooling Minimum Air Flow Fraction
    DesignDay,               !- Heating Design Air Flow Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    0.0,                     !- Heating Design Air Flow Rate {m3/s}   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    ,                        !- Heating Maximum Air Flow per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}
    ,                        !- Heating Maximum Air Flow {m3/s}
    ,                        !- Heating Maximum Air Flow Fraction
    ,                        !- Design Specification Zone Air Distribution Object Name
    ,                        !- Account for Dedicated Outdoor Air System
    ,                        !- Dedicated Outdoor Air System Control Strategy
    ,                        !- Dedicated Outdoor Air Low Setpoint Temperature for Design {C}
    ,                        !- Dedicated Outdoor Air High Setpoint Temperature for Design {C}
    Sensible Load Only No Latent Load,  !- Zone Load Sizing Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    HumidityRatioDifference, !- Zone Latent Cooling Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio Input Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    ,                        !- Zone Dehumidification Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio {kgWater/kgDryAir}
    0.005,                   !- Zone Cooling Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio Difference {kgWater/kgDryAir}   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    HumidityRatioDifference, !- Zone Latent Heating Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio Input Method   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.
    ,                        !- Zone Humidification Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio {kgWater/kgDryAir}
    0.005;                   !- Zone Humidification Design Supply Air Humidity Ratio Difference {kgWater/kgDryAir}   Default: the value equals the EnergyPlus default of this optional field.

  DesignSpecification:OutdoorAir,
    SZ DSOA G S2 Apartment,  !- Name
    Flow/Area,               !- Outdoor Air Method
    ,                        !- Outdoor Air Flow per Person {m3/s-person}
    0.000294105,             !- Outdoor Air Flow per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}  Source: xlsx raw_data!P40 Total OSA Ventilation = 0.026 m3/s (= this value x zone floor area, x multiplier for repeated floors); the xlsx lists 0 where the outdoor air is set at the air loop. Derivation of the value: xlsx Zone and HVAC System Summary Q471 (62-1999 cfm/person) = 27.5 cfm/person x 2.105 people per 1000 ft2 (2.00 people in the 949.9 ft2 of the zone) = 0.05789 cfm/ft2 x 0.000471947 m3/s per cfm / 0.09290304 m2 per ft2 = 0.000294105 m3/s-m2; the xlsx does not list the number of people of the outdoor air calculation separately: the people count here is the number that reproduces this result, and it differs from the design occupancy density N471 = 2.632 people per 1000 ft2.
    ;                        !- Outdoor Air Flow per Zone {m3/s}

  ZoneControl:Thermostat,
    G S2 Apartment Thermostat,  !- Name
    G S2 Apartment,          !- Zone or ZoneList Name
    ZONE CONTROL TYPE SCHED, !- Control Type Schedule Name
